# Qloo data rule ("Do not store Qloo response data in a public repository"): live captures and the
# recording made against them live under private/ and never enter git. The two generated modules
# are build artifacts (npm run prepare:data) rebuilt from private/ when present, else from the
# public placeholder fixtures, so they are not committed either.
private/
src/demo/fixtures.generated.ts
src/recorded.generated.ts
